			<p>In house session, themed presentations, sharing of country experiences, action plans by participants (if any), Gemstones Display on 1st Day (17th November 2026)</p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td>
			<p>Mode of Payment:</p>
			</td>
			<td>
			<p>Online deposit / cash directly deposit in NPO Pakistan bank (only) in favour of "National Productivity Organization"<br />
			Account No. 2169 3253 493 883<br />
			IBAN:PK09NBPA2169003253493883<br />
			Account Title: National Productivity Organization<br />
			National Bank of Pakistan (NBP), Stock Exchange Branch, Islamabad.</p>
			</td>
